OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm approved despite public
OL,4,Aobjection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed solar farm in rural
OL,7,FLincolnshire has been approved by the
OL,8,Fgovernment despite public concern.
OL,10,FThe Beacon Fen Energy Park, near
OL,11,FSleaford, is capable of powering up to
OL,12,F130,000 homes.
OL,14,FApproving the project, John Wheadon
OL,15,Ffrom the Planning Inspectorate said
OL,16,Fthere was an "urgent need" for the
OL,17,Fproposed development.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
