OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm approved despite public
OL,4,Aobjection
OL,5,
OL,6,FReacting to the news on social media,
OL,7,FConservative MP for Sleaford and North
OL,8,FHykeham, Dr Caroline Johnson, said the
OL,9,Fapproval was "another kick in the teeth
OL,10,Ffor local people who have campaigned
OL,11,Ftirelessly against it".
